Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Vehicle meshes and the differential-drive base model under models/ are derived from
ROBOTIS TurtleBot3 (github.com/ROBOTIS-GIT/turtlebot3), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Those files remain under their upstream license; the
dual license above applies to this project's own code, worlds, documentation and
generated assets.

Simulated runs also depend on software that is not vendored here and keeps its own
license: Gazebo / gz-sim, ROS 2 (rclpy, ros_gz bridge, rosbridge_suite),
Nav2, slam_toolbox, pointcloud_to_laserscan, and the local LLM runtime (ollama)
together with the models it serves (qwen3-vl:8b, qwen2.5:7b — each model carries
its own license terms from its publisher).

